 198.1424, 196.6255, 197.1338, 196.0173, 196.8338, 195.7334, 197.5055, 197.8306, 199.2347, 197.959, 196.3926, 195.5722, 194.0122, 195.9604, 196.2529, 197.2716, 198.5641, 199.6499, 200.039, 202.1082, 203.1017, 203.0347, 201.3077, 198.1519, 199.5684, 201.3099, 203.0732, 202.57, 200.6288, 203.791, 204.353, 206.1262, 205.2683, 205.0044, 202.3487, 199.7896, 200.7769, 199.4214, 201.7287, 201.8213, 203.8867, 203.6952, 205.4487, 203.7366, 204.5131, 206.1792, 203.7995, 203.608, 204.4308, 201.1711, 197.255, 194.8943, 195.1777, 194.2639, 192.3741, 192.3991, 191.3784, 190.7467, 189.2261, 191.5253, 191.7086, 189.4867, 189.1073, 189.428, 189.7021, 190.5809, 194.8867, 194.4603, 193.8309, 196.4941, 201.1421, 201.8916, 202.45, 203.1016, 205.5093, 205.4934, 206.9356, 208.3071, 206.5877, 202.8939, 201.9733, 204.7069, 204.5793, 205.5734, 202.2724, 200.7952, 199.97, 199.2378, 199.4506, 201.2039, 203.1215, 203.2903, 203.0163, 204.0403, 206.0526, 207.1756, 208.0262, 209.9742, 209.2004, 209.0482, 207.687, 205.7572, 207.3344, 206.8459, 212.7948, 213.8187, 215.5611, 214.7289, 213.9537, 215.6777, 216.5453, 219.0141, 223.4314, 221.3046, 225.0241, 224.4605, 225.792, 222.4151, 222.361, 221.5967, 219.9274, 219.739, 222.6573, 222.7168, 220.9056, 223.4933, 230.6341, 228.8274, 229.2088, 228.9211, 230.7044, 229.087, 228.506, 227.8218, 228.3405, 226.1194, 229.0598, 232.0663, null], "summary_html": "<h1>商品基本面量化研究之铁矿石 — 供需库存成本多因子</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>研报从铁矿石产业链出发，系统梳理了供给（进口矿发货量、国产矿产量、废钢替代）、需求（高炉开工率、粗钢产量、终端采购量）、库存（港口库存、钢厂库存）和成本（海运费、BDI）四大基本面维度对铁矿石价格的影响。使用IVX回归（解决内生性和持续性问题）发现基差、展期收益、利润等是显著预测指标，季频预测方向准确率达70.5%。</p>\n<p>我们提取研报的核心逻辑——基本面因子截面排名做多空——并泛化到全品种。使用可用的6个日频基本面字段（ry/basis/inventory_21/receipt/memberdiff20/profit），分别计算截面排名转连续信号，再组合为多因子策略。最终发现EMA平滑后的基差因子（basis_e60）表现最优，Sharpe 1.23。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>1.07</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>5.3%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>5.0%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-10.3%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.01</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2940</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.26</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>-0.29</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.69 / 0.99</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2014</th><th>2015</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>1.29</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.12</span></td><td>0.3</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.87</span></td><td>1.19</td><td>1.17</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.74</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.04</span></td><td>0.99</td><td>1.27</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.75</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.84</span></td><td>1.86</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>basis</code></td><td>基差</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每 20 个交易日</li>\n<li><strong>信号更新</strong>: 每日计算，每 20 天生效</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2942</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>98.4%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>40.0</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p><strong>单因子信号</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{rank}_{i,t} = \\frac{\\text{CrossSectionRank}(x_{i,t})}{N_t}, \\quad \\text{signal}_{i,t} = 2 \\cdot \\text{rank}_{i,t} - 1 \\in [-1, 1]</div>\n<p><strong>EMA平滑基差</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{basis\\_e60}_{i,t} = \\text{EMA}(\\text{basis}_{i,t}, \\text{span}=60)</div>\n<p><strong>波动率目标缩放</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{position}_{i,t} = \\text{signal}_{i,t} \\times \\frac{\\sigma_{\\text{target}}}{\\hat{\\sigma}_{i,t}^{60d}}</div>\n<p><strong>多因子组合</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{combo}_{i,t} = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum_{k=1}^{K} \\text{signal}_{k,i,t}</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-tex\">x_{i,t}</span> 为品种 <span class=\"math-tex\">i</span> 在 <span class=\"math-tex\">t</span> 日的因子值，<span class=\"math-tex\">N_t</span> 为截面品种数，<span class=\"math-tex\">\\sigma_{\\text{target}}=0.15</span>。</p>\n<h2>改进历程</h2>\n<p><strong>R1</strong>（Sharpe 1.12）：初始实现6个独立基本面因子（ry/basis/inventory/receipt/memberdiff20/profit）+ 等权组合。每个因子截面排名转连续信号，vol_target_scale + rebalance_hold(20)。基差因子（basis_value_raw）表现最优Sharpe 1.12。6因子等权组合Sharpe 0.87。换手率较高（0.57）。</p>\n<p><strong>R2</strong>（Sharpe 1.14）：诊断发现换手率过高是主要问题。扩展hold_days网格（10/20/40），发现hold=40改善换手（0.34）且Sharpe微升至1.14（basis_h40_raw）。添加sym_rolling_ic_gate但基差因子IC均匀分布，过滤效果不明显。3因子组合（ry+basis+profit）Sharpe 1.10，回撤仅-27.7%。</p>\n<p><strong>R3</strong>（Sharpe 1.23）：关键改进——引入EMA平滑基差（basis_e60）。原始基差日频波动大，EMA(60)平滑后信号更稳定。basis_e60_h20_raw Sharpe从1.12跳升至1.23，IC从0.013提升至0.021。组合变体普遍在1.05-1.10之间。</p>\n<p><strong>关键转折点</strong>：R3的EMA平滑贡献最大（+10% Sharpe），将基差因子从日频噪声中提纯。</p>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>品种范围</strong>: 全品种，实际有效约50个（基本面字段非空率20-45%）</li>\n<li><strong>持仓周期</strong>: 约20日再平衡</li>\n<li><strong>已知局限</strong>:</li>\n</ul>  - 与因子库现有basis_ema因子高度相关（corr=0.97）\n<p>- 2016年和2024年表现为负 - 基差因子本质上是价值因子，在趋势行情中可能滞后</p>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 0.29s</li>\n</ul>"}